\vspace{0.25mm}
\begin{itemize}[leftmargin=*,nosep]
\setlength\itemsep{0.4em}
\item We propose a novel finetuning method -- Orthogonal Finetuning for guiding text-to-image diffusion models towards better controllability. To further improve stability, we propose a constrained variant which limits the angular deviation from the pretrained model.
